cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FractalTextGuard: Structural Text Analysis via Long-Range Dependence"
version: 3.0.2
date-released: 2026-01-10
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18202981
authors:
  - family-names: Chechelnitsky
    given-names: Igor
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4607-1946
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for structural text analysis using Detrended 
  Fluctuation Analysis (DFA) and Long-Range Dependence (LRD) metrics.
  Calculates Hurst exponent, n-gram repetition rates, compression ratio,
  and entropy. Provides HEALTHY/WARNING/CRITICAL verdicts based on
  configurable thresholds. No external dependencies, fully offline.
keywords:
  - text analysis
  - Hurst exponent
  - DFA
  - detrended fluctuation analysis
  - long-range dependence
  - structural analysis
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/IgorChechelnitsky/FractalTextGuard
references:
  - type: generic
    title: "LRD Time Series Analysis Community"
    url: https://zenodo.org/communities/lrd-time-series/records
